ame.naver.com/lounge/Latale_Plus\n- 공식 디스코드 : https://discord.gg/XmCpjFRdG4\n- 고객센터: support_latale@vfivegames.com", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 1180, "minimumOsVersion": "11.0", "averageUserRating": 4.12542, "trackCensoredName": "라테일 플러스", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/%EB%9D%BC%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%BC-%ED%94%8C%EB%9F%AC%EC%8A%A4/id6477848779?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "genreIds": ["6014", "6016", "7014", "7001"], "primaryGenreName": "Games", "primaryGenreId": 6014, "price": 0.0, "userRatingCount": 1180}]}